{"title":"Lists and views","partialurl":"views","pagetemplateid":"b4700000-0000-4000-8000-2546863c3d7d","publishingstateid":"b4700000-0000-4000-8000-73c49e548d0c","hiddenfromsitemap":false,"sharedpageconfiguration":false,"displayorder":2.1,"isroot":false,"rootwebpageid":"b4800000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021","parentpageid":"b4800000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","copy":"<div class="demo" data-liquid-page="views"><p class="demo-kicker">Liquid / views</p><h1>Keep the view. Own the markup.</h1><p class="demo-lead">Compare the native account list with a custom Liquid table. Both use the existing list and exported views; table permissions still apply.</p>{% include 'Liquid navigation' active:'views' %}{{ snippets['Demo/Liquid guidance'] }}{% if user %}{% include 'Liquid custom view' list_id:'b4700000-0000-4000-8000-7194d58d3aa1' title:'Custom entityview' page_size:'4' %}<section class="demo-panel demo-native"><h2>The same native list</h2><p>Built-in entity_list rendering retains native list actions. The custom view above supplies its own markup and read navigation.</p><div class="demo-table-wrap">{% include 'entity_list' key:'b4700000-0000-4000-8000-7194d58d3aa1' %}</div></section>{% else %}<section class="demo-panel"><h2>Sign in to compare account views</h2><p>The account list is protected by exported table permissions.</p><a class="demo-button" href="/SignIn?returnUrl=%2Fliquid%2Fviews%2F">Choose your identity</a></section>{% endif %}<section class="demo-panel"><h2>Trace the metadata</h2><p>The entitylist block supplies available views. The entityview block selects a view and returns permission-scoped rows. Its column collection drives headers and cell lookup; a small partial formats values and account links.</p><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:20px;background:var(--demo-paper);border:1px solid var(--demo-border);border-radius:4px"><code>{% raw %}{% entitylist id:list_id %}
  {% entityview id:selected_view page:current_page page_size:4 %}
    {% for column in entityview.columns %}{{ column.name }}{% endfor %}
  {% endentityview %}
{% endentitylist %}{% endraw %}</code></pre></section></div>
","customcss":".demo[data-liquid-page] .view-grid{position:relative}
"}
